FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Je fais souvent mes courses ici.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ils proposent toujours de nouveaux
produits !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ich kaufe hier richtig gerne ein.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Jeden Tag gibt es was Neues
im Angebot.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Sí que te has ido lejos de compras!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
No te olvides de llevarle algún
detallito a la gente de tu pueblo.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Alışveriş için epey yol gelmişsin!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Evdekilerin hepsine birer
hatıra almalısın.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Did you get everything on your list?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's too long a trip to risk forgetting
something.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}¿Tienes ya todo lo que buscabas?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡No vaya a ser que te olvides algo
y tengas que repetir todo el viaje!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Tu es sûr{{TAG:000E:0006:000002006500}} de n'avoir rien oublié ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Après avoir fait tout ce chemin, ça
serait ballot !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Listendeki her şeyi aldın mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bir şeyi unutma riskine girmek
için yol fazla uzun.
